# Fixture: map_declare_independence's input (France 1599, SoL 59%, rebel_sentiment_report 48, no Crown slot).
# CHEAT Advance Revolution Status (Shift-F7, DOS case 0x68) is staged per press (port_bugs.md #1171):
#   1. sentiment < 75: sets it to 75 and, with no Crown slot, runs the War of the Spanish Succession (FUN_43f7_0218, @SUCCESSION notice);
#   2. declares independence (FUN_43f7_1a26 without the confirm): signing cinematic + @INDEPENDENCE letter;
#   3. foreign intervention announced (FUN_43f7_1528, @INTERVENTION);
#   4. independence_force set + DEBUG.TXT @FORCED notice.
# The turn number stays 107. Ends with cheat mode off again (Alt-W).
key w alt
key i alt
key n alt
key F7 shift
wait 20
key Return               # @SUCCESSION notice
wait 20
key F7 shift
wait 20
key Return               # signing cinematic: skip the animation
wait 20
key Return               # close the cinematic
wait 20
key Return               # @INDEPENDENCE letter OK
wait 20
key F7 shift
wait 20
key Return               # @INTERVENTION
wait 20
key F7 shift
wait 20
key Return               # @FORCED
wait 20
shot
key w alt
